<p>A <code>kanbanTableTd</code> is one part of a
  <a href="/components/kanban-table/"><code>kanbanTable</code></a>.
  It maps to the native HTML <code>&lt;th&gt;</code>
  element. See the <a href="/components/kanban-table/">Kanban Table
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

